This endpoint returns a summary of a user's overall quotas including:

- `allowed`: \<_integer_> quota limit.
- `inherited_from`: \<_string_> group from which the quota is inherited.
- `used`: \<_integer_> how many quota has been used.

Consumption data based on natural month and UTC.

